 Ashutosh Mishra — Developer Portfolio








A modern, responsive and animated developer portfolio built with React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, and Framer Motion.
This project is designed to showcase projects, skills, and experience in a visually appealing and professional way.

🌐 Live Website

🔗 Portfolio:
https://ashutoshdevprotfolio.netlify.app/

📌 Overview

This portfolio website highlights my work as a developer and provides an easy way for recruiters and collaborators to explore my projects and skills.

It includes:

Animated hero section

Skills showcase

Project gallery

Resume download

Contact section

Responsive design

The website focuses on performance, clean UI, and smooth animations.

✨ Features

✔ Animated hero section using Framer Motion
✔ Responsive design with Tailwind CSS
✔ Projects showcase with GitHub & Live Demo links
✔ Skills section with modern layout
✔ Resume download feature
✔ Mobile-friendly interface
✔ Clean and scalable React structure

🛠 Tech Stack
Frontend

React

Vite

Tailwind CSS

Framer Motion

React Icons

Tools

Git

GitHub

VS Code

Netlify (deployment)

⚙ Installation

Clone the repository and install dependencies.

git clone https://github.com/mishraashutosh25/6.PORTFOLIO.git
cd 6.PORTFOLIO

npm install
▶ Running the Project

Start development server:

npm run dev

Build production version:

npm run build

Preview production build:

npm run preview
